      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Coordinate metal drawing line shutdown, relocation and test runs.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 326777,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've documented the shutdown and startup procedure for the metal drawing line in A5, which covers task T6. Please review. I need to know the exact time window for shutdown on Friday to coordinate with production.",
            "mentions": [
              542601,
              534242
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 542601,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Thanks @326777. I'm checking the main schedule A1 now. Production has a final run that ends at 6 PM on Friday. To give them a buffer, can we schedule the official shutdown to begin at 7 PM?",
            "mentions": [
              326777
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 326777,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "7 PM works perfectly. That gives me enough time to run the shutdown sequence without rushing. I'll confirm that with the maintenance tech who is assisting.",
            "mentions": [
              542601
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 542601,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Great. Let's lock that in. Decision D7: Metal drawing line shutdown will commence at 7 PM on the first move Friday. I'll update A1.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 534242,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "I've read through A5. The steps are clear. My only question is on the test run criteria for T8. It says 'acceptable quality'. Can we define that more precisely? For example, 'three consecutive test runs with key dimensions within +/- 0.1mm tolerance and cycle time under 45 seconds'. Having clear targets prevents ambiguity.",
            "mentions": [
              326777
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 326777,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "That's a good point. I was going off my usual checks. Your suggestion is better because it's measurable. Those numbers are the correct baseline parameters. I'm happy to use that as the official criteria.",
            "mentions": [
              534242
            ],
